{"id":"5101","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5101_main_cirrocumulus-castellanus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这个一个复杂的天空，含有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">堡状</span>卷积云、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状</span>卷积云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波状层状</span>卷积云，排列成两层（复云云类）。还存在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛</span>卷云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密</span>卷云。卷云和卷积云的结合是中纬度天空的共同特征。</p>\n<p>如<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处，在地平线上可以看到几个凝结尾迹。</p>\n<p>当卷积云占主导时，编码为CH = 9。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国巴特克罗伊茨纳赫县","latitude":"纬度: 49° 50' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 7° 50' 32'' E","date":"07 December 2015 1439 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: P.2.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.2.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5101_syn_cirrocumulus-castellanus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>天气图表显示了照片拍摄前一小时的情况。有两个主要的锋面系统：一个暖锋，从北海的冰岛到延伸到德国北部；一个冷锋，从冰岛向南延伸到爱尔兰，再到比斯开湾。德国的大部分地区都在暖空气区域。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5101_upper_cirrocumulus-castellanus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从西南偏西40公里处探测 - 高水分含量在389和314 hPa处最高，459到366 hPa高度的条件不稳定</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5101_sat_cirrocumulus-castellanus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>有两个主要的锋面系统：一个暖锋，从北海的冰岛到延伸到德国北部；一个冷锋，从冰岛向南延伸到爱尔兰，再到比斯开湾。德国的大部分地区都在暖空气区域。在暖和的空气中，一些高云和中云已经形成。比荷卢经济联盟和德国西部地区有一小片高云和中云，向东延伸约50平行线。一个较弱的短波，上层槽线是形成这个云的原因。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2014","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}